Close private read-only log file handles explicitly instead of relying on
GC. Under PyPy (non-refcounting GC) that close can be delayed long enough
for the /summary page (which reads pytestLog for every recent build across
every builder) to leak enough file descriptors under load to hit EMFILE
and crash in-flight build bookkeeping (e.g. "unable to save build ...").

