Close the private read-only handle in LogFileProducer.getChunks too. Same
leak as the LogFile.getChunks fix above, on the live-log-streaming path: a
generator abandoned mid-stream (viewer navigates away) never reaches its
end, so the handle survives until PyPy's GC runs.

